# SSX (NPUB30892): fresh launch -> title -> autosave notice -> online-features dialog -> home, nothing more.
# The first minutes of a launch, where car8 reset 4 times on 2026-10-26. Frame-cued (see ssx_explore_drop.macro).
wait_screen ssx_ref/title.png 150 10
press_until start ssx_ref/autosave.png 30 6 5
press_until cross ssx_ref/online_dialog.png 150 20 5
press cross 150
sleep 25
snap r3_home
